===Etymology===
{{suffix|de|Hanf|ling}}

The bird was so called for its fondness for hemp seeds (cf. {{m+|en|linnet}}).  The colloquial usage for a person is by comparison to a hemp plant (cf. {{m+|en|beanpole}}).

